    <text x="60" y="333" font-family="'Mona Sans', -apple-system, sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="500" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.85)" stroke="rgba(0,0,0,0.45)" stroke-width="0.5" paint-order="stroke">1,055 contributions in the last year</text>
